        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So, I&#39;ve had my RC/IR box set for about a month now, and I&#39;ve noticed a very pronounced curvature developing in all of the new cards.&nbsp; It makes little actual difference, since new and old decks don&#39;t mix, but it bugs me.&nbsp; Has anyone else had this problem, and is there a terribly easy fix for it?&nbsp; I know if I put in a little elbow grease bending the cards back, or pressed them flat under heavy books over a series of weeks, it would correct the problem, but I&#39;m hoping for a less labor-intensive solution.</p>",
