        "created_at": "2014-01-13T04:59:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmm, maybe it's a new printing process? Do you riffle shuffle? If so, I typically will turn over my decks (of any sort) when shuffling, just to avoid this asymmetric bending.</p>",
